      "value": "It appears the avatar ID you shared might have been overwritten with one that doesn't express the bug. Could you provide a separate avatar ID where we can reproduce the issue? Also could you check if your issue is fixed in the current open beta version? There was a fix for an issue that could cause some things to break on remote avatars with FT.",
